#### §6.4 1 sym L936
pattern Arp(default root, steps = 4, gap = 4) -> (Note*):
    for i in 0..steps:
        Note/(root + i * gap)

Clip verse:
    Arp/48
    Arp/60 | steps=8 gap=3
#### §6.4 2 sym L946
